"Spud" <colin_fuidge@hotmail.com> writes:
> Is there a limit to how many hit points you can get from nurses via
> cursed scrolls of genocide?
> 
> It's just that on my first scroll I got about 80 HP and the second I
> got about 10. I've tried this (cheat) tactic before and I'm sure I got
> the same result.

Nurse HP gain has diminishing returns; there's a dieroll based on your
experience level, and you only gain max HP if your current max is
under that roll. So as it rises, further rises become less likely, and
it can't go beyond a certain point (25 * XL).

